WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.788
Five questions come first.

2
00:00:01.788 --> 00:00:06.296
Is the fifty million an equipment price
or five-year total cost of ownership,

3
00:00:06.296 --> 00:00:09.301
and what is bundled beyond
the distribution point?

4
00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:11.945
What will the distribution
point count be when

5
00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:14.725
co-management completes,
and in which fiscal year?

6
00:00:14.725 --> 00:00:16.988
What does each office's
circuit cost today?

7
00:00:16.988 --> 00:00:20.825
That one number decides whether
the alternative pays for itself.

8
00:00:20.825 --> 00:00:24.750
How many managed endpoints are there,
since that sets the server count?

9
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:29.150
And do branch security rules allow
devices to share content with each other?

10
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:32.780
Each answer comes from records
the agency already holds.
